The problem is that the player will eventually be in a situation where
they don't have enough daggers to kill all the monsters in the area.
Daggers are heavy, and you can't really carry a massive stack of
them.  I guess you could throw all your daggers, and spam Elbereth
while you slowly moved across the area to pick up the daggers, but
this seems like a horribly slow way to play the game.

But if the player actually had an idea to which monsters should be
killed with ranged attacks, then there is a much higher chance they
can actually defeat a large number of monsters (in the same area)
without running out of daggers.



